| Track | Status |
|-------|--------|
| Host-moderated turn-taking | **Shipped** — FIFO queue, hand raise UI, grant pause; polish: interrupt/yield, JSONL |
| Debate scenario | Not started |
| **Avatars** | **Next** — **VRM head/bust only** in `talkshow-web` (not full body); client-side Three.js + `talkshow/ui` events |

Implement against ROADMAP checklists; update ROADMAP when git-tracked scope ships.

## Dev split

- **Babel:** agent worker, vLLM, Piper — `sync-to-babel.sh` (excludes `talkshow-web/`)
- **Laptop:** `talkshow-web`, `api/tokens.py`
- Agent on Babel: sync/pull + restart worker (`.env` copied separately, not in git)

## Code style

- Minimal diff; match existing patterns in `agent/` and `talkshow-web/`.
- No commits unless the user explicitly asks.
